  {
   "id": "esd-clamp-test",
   "title": "ESD clamping test setup",
   "page": 6,
   "fixture": true,
   "description": "Bench arrangement for the clamping waveforms. An ESD tester with the IEC 61000-4-2 network (150 pF discharged through 330 Ω by a switch) fires into one line pin of the device, whose common pin is grounded and whose other line pin is left open. The same node feeds an RG 223/U 50 Ω coax, then a 40 dB attenuator, into a 4 GHz digital oscilloscope with a 50 Ω input.",
